name: feedback
description: File a round of upstream feedback to the maintainers of the seed this solet was born from — defects, questions, feature requests, closure confirmations, and RFC-shaped design proposals, every one of them as a GitHub issue through the repository's issue forms. The seed accepts bug reports and does not accept pull requests or patches. Runs the evidence discipline and the content gate before anything is published. Use on /feedback, and when the operator asks to report a bug, ask upstream a question, request a capability, propose a design, or confirm a fix.
